# Jet, Freedom Fighter, a 3/1: "When Jet enters, he deals damage equal to the number of creatures you control to target creature
# an opponent controls." Bot1 controls Ornithopter, Memnite and then Jet (three), so Jet deals 3 to Bot2's Hill Giant and kills it;
# the Ornithopters of both players do not add to the count, and Bot1's own Ornithopter is no legal target. "When Jet dies, put a
# +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures": Bot2 Bolts Jet on its turn and Bot1 puts one counter on its Memnite and one
# on Bot2's Ornithopter (any creature), a third target being refused.

